{"id":"paiement","lemma":"paiement","pos":"noun","rank":3827,"glosses":["payment"],"ipa":"/pɛ.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a5/Fr-le_paiement.ogg/Fr-le_paiement.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"paiements"},"formAudio":{"paiements":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/41/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-paiements.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je lui ai donné 5 dollars en paiement.","en":"I paid him five dollars.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"him, he, it"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to give","l":"donner"},{"g":"dollar","l":"dollar"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"Il exige le paiement immédiat.","en":"He demands immediate payment.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to demand, require","l":"exiger"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"immediate"}]},{"text":"Nous n'acceptons que les paiements en espèces.","en":"We only accept cash payment.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to accept","l":"accepter"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"type, sort, kind","l":"espèce"}]},{"text":"Quelles sont les options de paiement disponibles ?","en":"What payment options are available?","words":[{"g":"which","l":"quel"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"option","l":"option"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"available","l":"disponible"}]},{"text":"Nous effectuerons le paiement par virement bancaire.","en":"We will make the payment by bank transfer.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},null,{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"through"},{"g":"bank transfer"},{"g":"bank, banking"}]}]}